0001                  (            os9.d):00327         S$Wake              RMB       1                   Wake-up Sleeping Process
0002                  (            os9.d):00328         S$Abort             RMB       1                   Keyboard Abort
0003                  (            os9.d):00329         S$Intrpt            RMB       1                   Keyboard Interrupt
0004                  (            os9.d):00330         S$Window            RMB       1                   Window Change
     0004             (            os9.d):00331         S$HUP               EQU       S$Window            Hang Up
0005                  (            os9.d):00332         S$Alarm             RMB       1                   CoCo individual process' alarm signal
