0002                  (            os9.d):01016         PD.CNT              RMB       1                   Number of Open Images
0003                  (            os9.d):01017         PD.DEV              RMB       2                   Device Table Entry Address
0005                  (            os9.d):01018         PD.CPR              RMB       1                   Current Process
0006                  (            os9.d):01019         PD.RGS              RMB       2                   Caller's Register Stack
0008                  (            os9.d):01020         PD.BUF              RMB       2                   Buffer Address
000A                  (            os9.d):01021         PD.FST              RMB       32-.                File Manager's Storage
